# Instance user management errors
E16000 = The user details are invalid.
E16007 = The user was not found.
E16008 = This user has changed (current version { $current_version }). Refresh and try again.
E16009 = The expected revision must be a positive whole number.
E16011 = The reason must be at most { $max } characters.
E16012 = The page size must be between 1 and { $max }.
E16013 = Conflicting pagination arguments were supplied.
E16014 = The { $field } filter is invalid.
E16015 = The { $field } date range is invalid or reversed.
E16016 = The page cursor is invalid or does not belong to this search.
E16017 = The selected theme is invalid.
E16018 = The client mutation ID must be at most { $max } characters.
E16019 = User management storage is temporarily unavailable. No changes were committed.
E16020 = The user's access could not be invalidated. No changes were committed.
E16021 = Disable the user before deleting it.
E16022 = This user has no password and could not sign in without its second factors. Reset the password first.
E16023 = The session does not exist or does not belong to this user.
E16024 = You cannot perform this credential action on your own account. Manage your sign-in methods in the account center.
E16025 = Invitations need email delivery. Configure email first, or set an initial password.
E16026 = This user has no pending invitation.
E16027 = An invitation was sent recently. You can send another in { $seconds } seconds.
E16028 = The invitation email could not be sent. Try again later.
E16029 = Set an initial password or send an invitation.
E16030 = Enable this user before sending an invitation.
